---
// Rebuild of brand/scan-to-add.png. Two-column branches merge and split
// on wide screens; on phones the branches stack with an "or" between them.
---
<figure class="scan">
  <figcaption class="scan__title">Every scan ends in a handshake: the customer approves the connection in their own app</figcaption>
  <ol class="scan__steps">
    <li class="scan__row scan__row--pair">
      <div class="node"><strong>Scan with the phone camera</strong><span>Opens the link in a browser</span></div>
      <span class="or" aria-hidden="true">or</span>
      <div class="node"><strong>Photograph it in the AI app</strong><span>The agent reads the code itself</span></div>
    </li>
    <li class="joint joint--merge" aria-hidden="true"></li>
    <li class="scan__row">
      <div class="node node--narrow"><strong>One link per business</strong><span class="mono">gentifi.com/b/your-business</span></div>
    </li>
    <li class="joint joint--split" aria-hidden="true"><span class="tip tip--l"></span><span class="tip tip--r"></span></li>
    <li class="scan__row scan__row--pair">
      <div class="node"><strong>Browser gets a landing page</strong><span>Copy the shop’s link and add it in Claude,<br />ChatGPT or another AI app</span></div>
      <span class="or" aria-hidden="true">or</span>
      <div class="node"><strong>Agent gets machine-readable files</strong><span>Discovery manifest, MCP server card and SKILL.md</span></div>
    </li>
    <li class="joint joint--merge" aria-hidden="true"></li>
    <li class="scan__row">
      <div class="node node--narrow node--key"><strong>Customer approves in their app</strong><span>Signs in once; nothing installs silently</span></div>
    </li>
    <li class="joint" aria-hidden="true"></li>
    <li class="scan__row">
      <div class="node node--narrow"><strong>Agent connected</strong><span>Can now find, price, book and buy</span></div>
    </li>
  </ol>
</figure>

<style>
  .scan { margin: 0; --gap: 24px; --line: #8FA0AE; }
  .scan__title { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.15rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin-bottom: 28px; text-wrap: balance; }
  .scan__steps { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .scan__row { display: grid; gap: 10px; justify-items: stretch; }
  .or {
    justify-self: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }
  .node {
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 16px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    display: grid;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .node strong { font-size: 1.02rem; }
  .node span { color: var(--ink-muted); font-size: 0.93rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .node--key { background: var(--teal); border-color: var(--teal); color: var(--white); }
  .node--key span { color: var(--on-teal-muted); }

  /* Default joint: a single arrow down the middle */
  .joint {
    position: relative;
    height: 36px;
  }
  .joint::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%; top: 0; bottom: 6px;
    width: 2px;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: var(--line);
  }
  .joint::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%; bottom: 0;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    border: 6px solid transparent;
    border-top-color: var(--line);
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .tip { display: none; }

  @media (min-width: 720px) {
    .tip {
      display: block;
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      border: 6px solid transparent;
      border-top-color: var(--line);
      border-bottom: 0;
    }
    .tip--l { left: calc((100% - var(--gap)) / 4 + 1px); }
    .tip--r { right: calc((100% - var(--gap)) / 4 + 1px); transform: translateX(50%); }
    .scan__row--pair { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: var(--gap); }
    .scan__row--pair .or { display: none; }
    .node--narrow { width: 50%; justify-self: center; min-width: 320px; }

    /* Merge: two drops from column centres join, then one arrow down */
    .joint--merge, .joint--split { height: 48px; }
    .joint--merge {
      background:
        linear-gradient(var(--line), var(--line)) left calc((100% - var(--gap)) / 4) top 0 / 2px 50% no-repeat,
        linear-gradient(var(--line), var(--line)) right calc((100% - var(--gap)) / 4) top 0 / 2px 50% no-repeat,
        linear-gradient(var(--line), var(--line)) center top 50% / calc(50% + var(--gap) / 2 + 2px) 2px no-repeat;
    }
    .joint--merge::before { top: 50%; }

    /* Split: one line down, then branches to both column centres */
    .joint--split::before { bottom: 50%; }
    .joint--split::after { display: none; }
    .joint--split {
      background:
        linear-gradient(var(--line), var(--line)) center top 50% / calc(50% + var(--gap) / 2 + 2px) 2px no-repeat,
        linear-gradient(var(--line), var(--line)) left calc((100% - var(--gap)) / 4) bottom 6px / 2px calc(50% - 6px) no-repeat,
        linear-gradient(var(--line), var(--line)) right calc((100% - var(--gap)) / 4) bottom 6px / 2px calc(50% - 6px) no-repeat;
    }
  }
</style>
